<script setup>
import {computed} from 'vue';import {simulateFailure} from '../sim/models/failure.mjs';import {useLabSession} from '../sim/session.mjs';
const s=useLabSession('failure');const r=computed(()=>simulateFailure({operations:1000,s.timeoutRate:s.s.timeoutRate,s.retries:s.s.retries,s.idempotency:s.s.idempotency,s.verifyBeforeRetry:s.s.verify}));
</script><template><section class="sim-lab"><div class="sim-controls"><div><span>Provider timeout：{{Math.round(s.timeoutRate*100)}}%</span><input v-model.number="s.timeoutRate" type="range" min="0" max=".2" step=".01"></div><div><span>Retry 次數</span><div class="sim-segment"><button v-for="n in [0,1,3]" :key="n" :aria-pressed="s.retries===n" @click="s.retries=n">{{n}}</button></div></div><div><span>安全措施</span><div class="sim-segment"><button :aria-pressed="s.verify" @click="s.verify=!s.verify">先查證 {{s.verify?'ON':'OFF'}}</button><button :aria-pressed="s.idempotency" @click="s.idempotency=!s.idempotency">冪等 {{s.idempotency?'ON':'OFF'}}</button></div></div></div><div class="sim-system"><div class="sim-node"><b>Caller</b><span>1000 個 logical operations</span></div><div class="sim-arrow">→</div><div :class="['sim-node',{'is-warning':r.timedOut>0}]"><b>Provider</b><span>{{r.timedOut}} 次 timeout</span></div><div class="sim-arrow">→</div><div :class="['sim-node',{'is-critical':r.duplicateEffects>0}]"><b>Business effect</b><span>{{r.duplicateEffects}} 次重複效果</span></div></div><div class="sim-metrics"><div><span>總 provider calls</span><strong>{{r.providerLoad}}</strong></div><div><span>先查證成功</span><strong>{{r.verifiedBeforeRetry}}</strong></div><div :class="{'is-bad':r.duplicateEffects>0}"><span>重複效果</span><strong>{{r.duplicateEffects}}</strong></div><div :class="{'is-bad':r.unknown>0}"><span>仍然未知</span><strong>{{r.unknown}}</strong></div></div><div :class="['sim-consequence',{'is-bad':r.duplicateEffects>0}]"><strong>{{r.duplicateEffects?'Retry 讓副作用重複了':'目前沒有重複副作用'}}</strong><p>先把 Retry 從 0 調到 3，再分別開啟「先查證」和「冪等」。觀察 provider load、unknown outcome 和 duplicate effect 不會一起朝同一方向變好。</p></div></section></template>